1120 FOR I=1 TO NK:KI=(QI-1)*3+I:KX(KI)=INT(RND*8)+1:KY(KI)=INT(RND*8)+1:KH(KI)=100:NEXT I
1130 IF RND>.95 AND BASES<4 THEN G(GQX,GQY)=G(GQX,GQY)+10:BX(GQX,GQY)=INT(RND*8)+1:BY(GQX,GQY)=INT(RND*8)+1:BASES=BASES+1
